        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">For most people, the Sportsroyals Power Tower is the best power
            tower for the money</strong>, as long as you confirm the version you are buying. Choose
            the RELIFE for low ceilings and mixed heights, the Marcy TC-3515 for a tall frame from a
